        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bruce Ellingsen, Pedro Guerrero\n- Organizations: Cleveland Indians, Gulf Coast Indians, Los Angeles Dodgers, St. Louis Cardinals, Major League Baseball\n- Roles: professional baseball player\n\nFacts:\n- Pedro Guerrero was born on June 29, 1956, and he is a Dominican former professional baseball player.\n- In the context of Bruce Ellingsen, the Cleveland Indians gave up Pedro Guerrero when Guerrero was 17 years old and had one year of professional experience with the Rookie-classification Gulf Coast Indians.\n- Pedro Guerrero played all or part of fifteen seasons in Major League Baseball from 1978 to 1992 with the Los Angeles Dodgers and St. Louis Cardinals.",
